Investigating Misinformation: Identify and Analyze Public Registrant Information Using WhoisXML API Transforms (https://register.gotowebinar.com/register/4534650253299084299?source=Whoisxmlapi?mc=mail_campaign&mc_cid=62089831fd&mc_eid=UNIQID)
