Join WhoisXML API and Maltego for an exclusive webinar where we expose dozens of domain names that point to Iranian and Iran-linked news sites to see if some of their infrastructures are still running, post the U.S. government seizing several websites stated to be involved in misinformation campaigns. (https://register.gotowebinar.com/register/4534650253299084299?source=Whoisxmlapi?mc=mail_campaign&mc_cid=62089831fd&mc_eid=UNIQID)
In this webinar, WhoisXML API and Maltego experts will investigate what those websites used to host, their ownership attribution, and other internet properties connected to them using the capabilities of Maltego and Intel from WhoisXML API. (https://register.gotowebinar.com/register/4534650253299084299?source=Whoisxmlapi?mc=mail_campaign&mc_cid=62089831fd&mc_eid=UNIQID)
Highlights From This Session Background on the US seizing Iran PressTV and other Iran-linked news sites - Investigating & identifying the content of key websites before they were seized - Establishing ownership of these websites using historical WHOIS data - Building connected domain footprints as a basis for additional analysis (https://register.gotowebinar.com/register/4534650253299084299?source=Whoisxmlapi?mc=mail_campaign&mc_cid=62089831fd&mc_eid=UNIQID)
